---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Icon from "../components/Icon.tsx";
---

<Layout>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <div class="mb-12" style="padding-right: 40px;">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 mb-12">
      <p class="font-medium m-0 text-heading" style="font-size: 20px;">
        &gt; halvard_mørstad
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/halvardssm"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          aria-label="GitHub"
        >
          <Icon name="brand-github" size={16} color="var(--color-dim)" />
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/halvard-mørstad-4b8b13144/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          aria-label="LinkedIn"
        >
          <Icon name="brand-linkedin" size={16} color="var(--color-dim)" />
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:halvard@morstad.eu" aria-label="Email">
          <Icon name="mail" size={16} color="var(--color-dim)" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="m-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;">
      // Cloud and infrastructure engineer, occasionally full-stack.<br />
      // Ten years in, still enjoy picking up a stack I've never touched.<br />
      // These days that extends to leading the people who build alongside me.<br
      />
      // Comfortable down to the metal — Rust, Go, and the occasional x86 detour.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- CTA buttons -->
  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5 mb-8">
    <a
      href="mailto:halvard@morstad.eu"
      class="btn-primary"
      style="padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 13px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center;"
    >
      $ lets_talk()
    </a>
    <a
      href="/work"
      class="btn-outline"
      style="padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 13px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center;"
    >
      cd ./work
    </a>
    <a
      href="/blog"
      class="btn-outline"
      style="padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 13px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center;"
    >
      cd ./blog
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- Link to non-technical version -->
  <a
    href="/about"
    class="btn-outline"
    style="padding: 20px 24px; font-size: 13px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; margin-bottom: 2rem; text-decoration: none;"
  >
    <Icon name="click" size={28} color="var(--color-link)" />
    <span
      >I can also present to your&nbsp;<br />non-technical stakeholders&nbsp;<br
      />— see that view here</span
    >
  </a>

  <!-- Ways to work with me -->
  <p class="m-0 mb-2.5 text-dim" style="font-size: 12px;">
    // ways to work with me
  </p>
  <div
    class="grid gap-2.5 mb-8"
    style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));"
  >
    <div class="card" style="padding: 1rem;">
      <Icon name="code" size={16} color="#85b7eb" />
      <p
        class="font-medium m-0 mt-2.5 mb-1 text-heading"
        style="font-size: 14px;"
      >
        Hands-on engineering
      </p>
      <p class="m-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6;">
        Cloud, infra, and full-stack builds you can hand off with confidence.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="padding: 1rem;">
      <Icon name="bulb" size={16} color="#f0997b" />
      <p
        class="font-medium m-0 mt-2.5 mb-1 text-heading"
        style="font-size: 14px;"
      >
        Advisory and greenfield builds
      </p>
      <p class="m-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6;">
        Pick the right stack, validate before committing budget, or find what's
        broken.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="padding: 1rem;">
      <Icon name="users" size={16} color="#97c459" />
      <p
        class="font-medium m-0 mt-2.5 mb-1 text-heading"
        style="font-size: 14px;"
      >
        Fractional leadership
      </p>
      <p class="m-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6;">
        Interim CTO work, team building, and technical strategy.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- About -->
  <div class="pb-5 mt-8">
    <p class="m-0 mb-2 text-dim" style="font-size: 12px;">// about</p>
    <p class="m-0 text-muted mb-3" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8;">
      I'm a cloud and infrastructure engineer with a full-stack background. Ten
      years across startups and enterprise, now splitting my time between
      hands-on engineering, technical leadership, and freelance work.
    </p>
    <p class="m-0 mb-1.5 text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;">
      <span class="text-dim">// leadership</span>
      <span>
        — I've led teams of up to 8 engineers, set technical direction, and
        mentored juniors. I'm comfortable as interim CTO or embedding into an
        existing team.</span
      >
    </p>
    <p class="m-0 mb-1.5 text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;">
      <span class="text-dim">// adaptability</span>
      <span>
        — I pick up unfamiliar stacks quickly — comfortable across the stack
        from frontend to infrastructure to low-level systems. I've evaluated and
        adopted technologies for proof-of-concepts and greenfield projects.</span
      >
    </p>
    <p class="m-0 mb-1.5 text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;">
      <span class="text-dim">// mentoring</span>
      <span>
        — I mentor junior engineers and previously taught programming. I also
        write technical content, including a course on Newline.co.</span
      >
    </p>
    <p class="m-0 mb-1.5 text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;">
      <span class="text-dim">// on ai</span>
      <span>
        — AI is a tool, not a replacement. I use it to accelerate workflows —
        scaffolding, test generation, code review — but the engineer's job
        shifts from writing code to evaluating it. Used well, it cuts cost and
        cycle time. Used poorly, it generates more rework than it saves.</span
      >
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Stats -->
  <div
    class="flex gap-6 py-4 mb-5"
    style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);"
  >
    <div>
      <span class="text-heading font-medium" style="font-size: 20px;">~10</span>
      <span class="block text-dim" style="font-size: 11px;"
        >years experience</span
      >
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="text-heading font-medium" style="font-size: 20px;">8</span>
      <span class="block text-dim" style="font-size: 11px;">engineers led</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="text-heading font-medium" style="font-size: 20px;">25+</span>
      <span class="block text-dim" style="font-size: 11px;"
        >projects shipped</span
      >
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Use cases -->
  <p class="m-0 mb-3 text-dim" style="font-size: 12px;">
    // what I can do for you
  </p>
  <div class="mb-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-3">
      <p class="m-0 text-dim" style="font-size: 12px;">
        // migrate to the cloud
      </p>
      <p class="m-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;">
        Lift a legacy setup into containerized infra — I handle the migration,
        CI/CD, and cutover with minimal downtime.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-3"
      style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);"
    >
      <p class="m-0 text-dim" style="font-size: 12px;">
        // ship a full-stack app
      </p>
      <p class="m-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;">
        From a blank repo to a deployed product — I build the frontend, API, and
        database layer.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-3"
      style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);"
    >
      <p class="m-0 text-dim" style="font-size: 12px;">
        // harden your infrastructure
      </p>
      <p class="m-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;">
        I audit your current setup, find what's fragile, and make it reliable —
        observability, autoscaling, and disaster recovery.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-3"
      style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);"
    >
      <p class="m-0 text-dim" style="font-size: 12px;">
        // build a greenfield service
      </p>
      <p class="m-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;">
        When you need to validate an idea fast — I pick the stack, build a PoC,
        and hand it off with docs.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-3"
      style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);"
    >
      <p class="m-0 text-dim" style="font-size: 12px;">
        // lead your engineering team
      </p>
      <p class="m-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;">
        Interim or fractional — I set technical direction, mentor your juniors,
        and keep delivery moving.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-3"
      style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);"
    >
      <p class="m-0 text-dim" style="font-size: 12px;">
        // evaluate a new stack
      </p>
      <p class="m-0 text-muted" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;">
        Before you commit budget, I prototype with the candidate technologies
        and give you a grounded recommendation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <div class="pt-3.5" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
    <p class="m-0 text-dim" style="font-size: 11px;">© halvard mørstad</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
